# Normalize line endings to LF in the repo (constitution-safe infra).
# Rust source, YAML/JSON/TOML configs, and shell scripts all use LF.
# Windows checkouts keep LF because core.autocrlf is false; editors handle display.

* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary assets must never be filtered.
*.png  binary
*.jpg  binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif  binary
*.ico  binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf  binary
*.otf  binary
